{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-4074508","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年台湾淡水老街之旅","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"记录淡水老街、八里左岸与故宫参观见闻，也分享足底按摩和正式活动前尽情享受台湾的轻松一天。","date":"2016-06-12","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 台湾:淡水老街","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 台湾:淡水老街","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4074508.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160613213952id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4074508.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":388,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-4074508/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/001-ea69e7103f.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[1009,699],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"记录淡水老街、八里左岸与故宫参观见闻，也分享足底按摩和正式活动前尽情享受台湾的轻松一天。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"昨天的一天\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/001-ea69e7103f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/001-ea69e7103f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1009\" height=\"699\"></a></figure>\n夜场正式活动开始前还有时间\n所以去观光了！\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/002-29c4ca0c83.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/002-29c4ca0c83.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"426\" height=\"548\"></a></figure>\n\n金碧辉煌的寺庙！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/003-6afa3c62c2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/003-6afa3c62c2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1122\" height=\"752\"></a></figure>\n\n小摊好多！\n还有巨大的炸鱿鱼！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/004-34f9d40705.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/004-34f9d40705.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n感觉气氛真不错！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/005-a668c8eb20.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/005-a668c8eb20.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n还有一只大大的皮卡丘哦！\n抓娃娃机里的皮卡丘也有好多！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/006-2b5902e738.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/006-2b5902e738.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"616\" height=\"735\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n坐上船\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/007-471615b023.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/007-471615b023.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"680\"></a></figure>\n\n背后有山的城市\n\n前往八里左岸！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/008-ef252f27a6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/008-ef252f27a6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n以淡水老街为背景！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/009-5f30fb8a43.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/009-5f30fb8a43.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n八里左岸的小摊也多得不得了！\n看起来每样都好好吃！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n听说这里以贝类闻名\n所以午餐就多点了些贝类！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/010-f42dcb8c44.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/010-f42dcb8c44.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n每样都好好吃——！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/011-7e7cfc51d4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/011-7e7cfc51d4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n听说卤蛋也很有名，所以买来当伴手礼！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n                            换个地方\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/012-419fe1add0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/012-419fe1add0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"496\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n                        还去了国立故宫博物院！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这里有各种各样的文化瑰宝\n虽然其中有些东西\n即使到了现代\n也依然不知道是用什么技术制作出来的\n内容非常有意思！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n说到台湾，我就想到了这个……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n正式活动开始前……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n足底按摩！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/013-dad018923a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/013-dad018923a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n还没开始按、还不痛时的表情（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n                            之后\n                        \n\n腰部和脖子也接受了按摩\n整个人神清气爽！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这次真是尽情享受台湾了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n就在这之后\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/台湾:シークレットゲスト : 増田順一 公式ブログ http:/lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4073542.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">迎来了正式活动！</a>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！","markdown_ja":"昨日の1日\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/001-ea69e7103f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/001-ea69e7103f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1009\" height=\"699\"></a></figure>\n夜の本番まで時間があったので\n観光しました！\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/002-29c4ca0c83.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/002-29c4ca0c83.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"426\" height=\"548\"></a></figure>\n\n煌びやかなお寺！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/003-6afa3c62c2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/003-6afa3c62c2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1122\" height=\"752\"></a></figure>\n\n屋台がたくさん！\n巨大なイカ揚げも！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/004-34f9d40705.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/004-34f9d40705.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nなんか良い雰囲気！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/005-a668c8eb20.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/005-a668c8eb20.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n大きなピカチュウもいたよ！\nクレーンゲームのピカチュウはたくさんいた！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/006-2b5902e738.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/006-2b5902e738.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"616\" height=\"735\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n船に乗って\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/007-471615b023.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/007-471615b023.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"680\"></a></figure>\n\n後ろの山のある街\n\n八里（バリ）左岸へ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/008-ef252f27a6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/008-ef252f27a6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n淡水老街をバックに！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/009-5f30fb8a43.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/009-5f30fb8a43.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n八里左岸も屋台が半端ない！\nどれも美味しそう！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n貝で有名らしいので\n貝多めなランチ！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/010-f42dcb8c44.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/010-f42dcb8c44.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nどれも美味いー！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/011-7e7cfc51d4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/011-7e7cfc51d4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nそして煮タマゴが有名らしくお土産に！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                            場所を移動して\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/012-419fe1add0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/012-419fe1add0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"496\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n                        国立故宮博物院にも！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさまざな文化的なものが\nありましたが\nどういう技術で作ったのか\n現代でも分からないものもあり\n興味深い内容でした！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n台湾といえば！と思い・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n本番前に・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n足裏マッサージ！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/013-dad018923a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4074508/013-dad018923a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nまだやられてない痛くないときの顔（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                            その後\n                        \n腰と首もマッサージしてもらって\nスッキリ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nかなーり台湾を満喫しました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\nこの後\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/台湾:シークレットゲスト : 増田順一 公式ブログ http:/lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4073542.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">本番を迎えたのでした！</a>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！"}}